(4210443, 607063, 64670, '<td valign="top">As Halloween isn''t really celebrated in our country I''ll have to assume that this sort of costume and imagery is what would be ''normal'' in your country.  It''s a great image, except for the harsh lighting on her face - just not my impression of Halloween.</td>', 'As Halloween isn''t really celebrated in our country I''ll have to assume that this sort of costume and imagery is what would be ''normal'' in your country.  It''s a great image, except for the harsh lighting on her face - just not my impression of Halloween.', '2007-11-01 00:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210449, 607435, 64670, '<td valign="top">I think the yellow tinge is a bit ''too'' much.  I''d have liked to see it more spooky. With editing you had options to blur out the background some, selectively colour correct and maybe desat somewhat.</td>', 'I think the yellow tinge is a bit ''too'' much.  I''d have liked to see it more spooky. With editing you had options to blur out the background some, selectively colour correct and maybe desat somewhat.', '2007-11-01 00:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
