(4211808, 607229, 55005, '<td valign="top">I am not too hot about the processing here -- the white is too distracting and a lot of details in the texture are missing.  I would have liked to see a cleaner background -- the bowls and the paws of another cat (?) just pull atention away from the black cat and the pumpkin.</td>', 'I am not too hot about the processing here -- the white is too distracting and a lot of details in the texture are missing.  I would have liked to see a cleaner background -- the bowls and the paws of another cat (?) just pull atention away from the black cat and the pumpkin.', '2007-11-01 10:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4211810, 607162, 35994, '<td valign="top">lol, this is very neat. Looks like the groundskeeper for that house in the background.</td>', 'lol, this is very neat. Looks like the groundskeeper for that house in the background.', '2007-11-01 10:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4211819, 607401, 55005, '<td valign="top">There is too much going on here.  A tighter crop without the tree and the blus triangle would have really brought my attention to the tombstones. The lights along the path are a bit blown out.</td>', 'There is too much going on here.  A tighter crop without the tree and the blus triangle would have really brought my attention to the tombstones. The lights along the path are a bit blown out.', '2007-11-01 10:18:41.000000', NULL, 1);
