(4211853, 607419, 35994, '<td valign="top">Haha, that''s funny! I like that you can still see the real eyes behind the mask.</td>', 'Haha, that''s funny! I like that you can still see the real eyes behind the mask.', '2007-11-01 10:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4211854, 607326, 63398, '<td valign="top">Aww!! Too cute for words!!! What a FACE!!!!! This is just so excellent on so many counts. Great negative space, rule of thirds, color, detail, focus, subject, composition, and like I said, that face just goes right to my heart. I don''t know if this will score as it should because it borders on too subtle, but it gets a 10 from me. Thanks for a beautiful, heartwarming image.</td>', 'Aww!! Too cute for words!!! What a FACE!!!!! This is just so excellent on so many counts. Great negative space, rule of thirds, color, detail, focus, subject, composition, and like I said, that face just goes right to my heart. I don''t know if this will score as it should because it borders on too subtle, but it gets a 10 from me. Thanks for a beautiful, heartwarming image.', '2007-11-01 10:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4211857, 607241, 35994, '<td valign="top">Spooky! I really like all the red leaves, your ghost looks pretty real too, nicely done.</td>', 'Spooky! I really like all the red leaves, your ghost looks pretty real too, nicely done.', '2007-11-01 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4211860, 607232, 35994, '<td valign="top">Eww, your normal small worm in an apple gives you the heebiejeebies let alone a big hairy one!</td>', 'Eww, your normal small worm in an apple gives you the heebiejeebies let alone a big hairy one!', '2007-11-01 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
