(4211864, 607372, 35994, '<td valign="top">Very piercing eyes, and talk about an extreme costume, what did you use to hold all that hair on? Neat!</td>', 'Very piercing eyes, and talk about an extreme costume, what did you use to hold all that hair on? Neat!', '2007-11-01 10:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
