(4212273, 607185, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice costume.  Lighting is not subtle, but this looks like a night shot and they''re tough!</td>', 'Nice costume.  Lighting is not subtle, but this looks like a night shot and they''re tough!', '2007-11-01 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
