(4212287, 607331, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  But ... I would much rather see light coming through the eye sockets than at the corners of the image and randomly next to the hand.  Halloweeny, though.</td>', 'Interesting.  But ... I would much rather see light coming through the eye sockets than at the corners of the image and randomly next to the hand.  Halloweeny, though.', '2007-11-01 12:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212289, 607472, 65234, '<td valign="top">Jack looks like he''s been around awhile.  Nice use of selective desat to emphasize him.</td>', 'Jack looks like he''s been around awhile.  Nice use of selective desat to emphasize him.', '2007-11-01 12:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212293, 607272, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not happily costumed, eh?  I didn''t bother any of my guys this year.  Nice exposure and crop on this.</td>', 'Not happily costumed, eh?  I didn''t bother any of my guys this year.  Nice exposure and crop on this.', '2007-11-01 12:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212295, 607453, 65234, '<td valign="top">That gigantic spider is a particularly effective touch.  You got a lot of good detail on this shot.</td>', 'That gigantic spider is a particularly effective touch.  You got a lot of good detail on this shot.', '2007-11-01 12:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212299, 607312, 63398, '<td valign="top">I know you''re getting pinged right and left on darkness and negative space. I love this image! It''s just plain flat creepy; evocative of all the horrors that you can conjure up on a cold, dank spooky night. This thing has got to be sitting at the house that no kid in his right mind will go within 100 yards ''cause they KNOW that the boogeyman lives there! 7 to help offset any bad votes.....8&gt;)</td>', 'I know you''re getting pinged right and left on darkness and negative space. I love this image! It''s just plain flat creepy; evocative of all the horrors that you can conjure up on a cold, dank spooky night. This thing has got to be sitting at the house that no kid in his right mind will go within 100 yards ''cause they KNOW that the boogeyman lives there! 7 to help offset any bad votes.....8>)', '2007-11-01 12:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212302, 607372, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely costumed (the yellow teeth are particularly lovely).  DOF looks a tiny bit too shallow; eyes are nicely focussed but nose is soft at the end and then I see sharpening artifacts (bright white dots) just past the soft bit.</td>', 'Nicely costumed (the yellow teeth are particularly lovely).  DOF looks a tiny bit too shallow; eyes are nicely focussed but nose is soft at the end and then I see sharpening artifacts (bright white dots) just past the soft bit.', '2007-11-01 13:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212304, 607216, 63398, '<td valign="top">You''re gonna burn in Hell for this one! LOL!!!</td>', 'You''re gonna burn in Hell for this one! LOL!!!', '2007-11-01 13:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212306, 607373, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like a painting.  Border actually works nicely here.</td>', 'Looks a bit like a painting.  Border actually works nicely here.', '2007-11-01 13:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212309, 607305, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice Gothic lighting.</td>', 'Nice Gothic lighting.', '2007-11-01 13:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212313, 607051, 65234, '<td valign="top">Those balloony things are starting to dominate every holiday!  I would prefer shallower DOF here so the competing elements are muted.  Looking at it some more ... the shadow on the balloon could have been a fun thing to play with and emphasize for something different.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Those balloony things are starting to dominate every holiday!  I would prefer shallower DOF here so the competing elements are muted.  Looking at it some more ... the shadow on the balloon could have been a fun thing to play with and emphasize for something different.  Just a thought.', '2007-11-01 13:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212315, 607371, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of lighting, especially getting the eye on the dark side lit.  He doesn''t look like a happy punkinhead ...</td>', 'Very nice use of lighting, especially getting the eye on the dark side lit.  He doesn''t look like a happy punkinhead ...', '2007-11-01 13:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212319, 607064, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not sure how I feel about the harsh lighting.  The shadows are kind of fun for Halloween, but from a photographic perspective I''m put off by the large areas of blown highlights.</td>', 'Not sure how I feel about the harsh lighting.  The shadows are kind of fun for Halloween, but from a photographic perspective I''m put off by the large areas of blown highlights.', '2007-11-01 13:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212320, 607476, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice shadow!  Like the ineffective little trap in the background, too.</td>', 'Very nice shadow!  Like the ineffective little trap in the background, too.', '2007-11-01 13:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212326, 607477, 65234, '<td valign="top">How ... um, adorable isn''t the right word ... Halloweeny!  Nicely lit, too.</td>', 'How ... um, adorable isn''t the right word ... Halloweeny!  Nicely lit, too.', '2007-11-01 13:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4212327, 607327, 30791, '<td valign="top">Now thats ART</td>', 'Now thats ART', '2007-11-01 13:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
