(4214045, 607257, 33542, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, I like the lighting, even though the hat is very dark. Good mood lighting. The only thing I don''t like is the red glove. Would have preferred just a hand. Also, does this vampire only have one tooth?</td>', 'Ohhh, I like the lighting, even though the hat is very dark. Good mood lighting. The only thing I don''t like is the red glove. Would have preferred just a hand. Also, does this vampire only have one tooth?', '2007-11-01 22:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214049, 607275, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I''m not real fond of the odd orangy color and super high contrast. Might have been better if you''d lowered the saturation of green, etc. without completely making it greytone. Also, I don''t mind the border, but DPCers tend to dislike them.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I''m not real fond of the odd orangy color and super high contrast. Might have been better if you''d lowered the saturation of green, etc. without completely making it greytone. Also, I don''t mind the border, but DPCers tend to dislike them.', '2007-11-01 22:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214052, 607435, 33542, '<td valign="top">It''s appearing a bit pixilated on my screen. Colors are awfully bright, too, I''d recommend a little bit of desat.</td>', 'It''s appearing a bit pixilated on my screen. Colors are awfully bright, too, I''d recommend a little bit of desat.', '2007-11-01 22:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214059, 607121, 33542, '<td valign="top">Ewww, creepy! Is this a person''s costume? The colors are great. Looks almost like the moon. My only real complaints are about the depth of field (it bothers me that the righthand web gets out of focus so quickly) and the darkness of the left side of the face (a reflector would have been great here).</td>', 'Ewww, creepy! Is this a person''s costume? The colors are great. Looks almost like the moon. My only real complaints are about the depth of field (it bothers me that the righthand web gets out of focus so quickly) and the darkness of the left side of the face (a reflector would have been great here).', '2007-11-01 22:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214063, 607373, 33542, '<td valign="top">I would have ranked this picture higher without the glowing effect. The dress and hair are also a little too dark, imo.</td>', 'I would have ranked this picture higher without the glowing effect. The dress and hair are also a little too dark, imo.', '2007-11-01 22:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
