(4214091, 607304, 33542, '<td valign="top">The cat''s eye color is odd and the focus is a little soft, especially around the cat''s feet. I like the black cat on the book and in person, though  :)</td>', 'The cat''s eye color is odd and the focus is a little soft, especially around the cat''s feet. I like the black cat on the book and in person, though  :)', '2007-11-01 22:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
