(4217771, 607453, 55838, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge.  Nicely muted color tones and what a great decoration job!  I wish that it wasn''t so tight on the house but of course that would be assuming that the house has eerie trees etc. surrounding it (which of course it probably doesn''t)!  Nicely done.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge.  Nicely muted color tones and what a great decoration job!  I wish that it wasn''t so tight on the house but of course that would be assuming that the house has eerie trees etc. surrounding it (which of course it probably doesn''t)!  Nicely done.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2007-11-03 08:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4217773, 607461, 55838, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot with a  great title.  A true-to-life kid moment captured. A little bit sharper focus on her eyes would make this a little stronger for me but very nice job.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Lovely shot with a  great title.  A true-to-life kid moment captured. A little bit sharper focus on her eyes would make this a little stronger for me but very nice job.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2007-11-03 08:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
