(4249167, 607274, 6118, '<td valign="top">This was shot in RAW and edited quite extensively in CS3.  I brightened the fire and darkened a lot of the stuff in the lower right. And I had to do a fair amount to the central figure and the thing on the spit to make it stand out better.  There was too big a crowd for me to use a tripod so I suppose it could be classified as a snapshot.</td>', 'This was shot in RAW and edited quite extensively in CS3.  I brightened the fire and darkened a lot of the stuff in the lower right. And I had to do a fair amount to the central figure and the thing on the spit to make it stand out better.  There was too big a crowd for me to use a tripod so I suppose it could be classified as a snapshot.', '2007-11-15 11:25:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4250013, 607453, 17990, '<td valign="top">HEYYYY!!!! congratulations!!!!! I haven´t been online that much but it sooo cool to come back and found your new ribbon!!!! great picture!!!! I am so happy for you!</td>', 'HEYYYY!!!! congratulations!!!!! I haven´t been online that much but it sooo cool to come back and found your new ribbon!!!! great picture!!!! I am so happy for you!', '2007-11-15 17:31:01.000000', NULL, 0),
