(4402447, 607305, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, congratulation on the 4th place finish.  I think this shot deserved to be on the front page, but it is still a nice finish.  The lighting on this is really awesome and the red streak in the hair and lips really brings this image together.  I am sure  you aren''t as evil as you appear in this photo, but the photo is very convincing otherwise!</td>', 'This is a great shot, congratulation on the 4th place finish.  I think this shot deserved to be on the front page, but it is still a nice finish.  The lighting on this is really awesome and the red streak in the hair and lips really brings this image together.  I am sure  you aren''t as evil as you appear in this photo, but the photo is very convincing otherwise!', '2008-01-18 11:35:24.000000', NULL, 0),
