(4632487, 607241, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh I did not comment on this during the challenge!  I gave this an 8.  I thought this was sooo cool looking and it really does look like an apparition.  What a fun picture.  I''m glad it did so well!</td>', 'Oh I did not comment on this during the challenge!  I gave this an 8.  I thought this was sooo cool looking and it really does look like an apparition.  What a fun picture.  I''m glad it did so well!', '2008-04-11 10:24:48.000000', NULL, 0),
